   {
    "attributes": [
     {
      "_key": "227mFCOl8uclHuS5roWFpW",
      "name": "Why I'm standing",
      "value": "Politics wasn't the plan, but I've watched policy made on vibes instead of numbers. I couldn't ignore this anymore. I needed to get on the field and tackle what's hurting Kiwis. I want to restore faith in our democracy. As a young Kiwi, I walked around our glass ceiling of opportunity. Now I'm here to break through it, for all of us, with integrity. New Zealand should be a place to grow, not just settle."
     },
     {
      "_key": "227mFCOl8uclHuS5roWFsL",
      "name": "About me",
      "value": "I'm not learning about Wigram from a briefing paper, I've grown up in it. A good representative listens first and does the numbers before making promises. It is about public service, not a power grab. Wigram needs a representative who you know has your best interests at heart. That's the standard I'll hold myself to. I'm passionate about our country. I've even sung our national anthem at public events on the fly to prove it!"
     },
     {
      "_key": "227mFCOl8uclHuS5roWFvA",
      "name": "Priority 1",
      "value": "Reduce grocery & power bills by breaking up the supermarket duopoly & power companies."
     },
     {
      "_key": "227mFCOl8uclHuS5roWFxz",
      "name": "Priority 2",
      "value": "Push for road & infrastructure investment to keep pace with Wigram's population growth."
     },
     {
      "_key": "227mFCOl8uclHuS5roWG0o",
      "name": "Priority 3",
      "value": "Ensure essential community services are locally accessible to Wigram's growing population."
     }
    ],
